<graph edgedefault="directed"><node id="40540f90-c462-4dab-9e61-80aa1b26d734">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Indexed Universal Life Policy","text":"╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║          INDEXED UNIVERSAL LIFE INSURANCE POLICY                  ║\n║          Horizon Wealth Protection Insurance                      ║\n╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\nPolicy Number: HWP-IUL-2024-7290\nDate of Issue: October 3, 2024\nForm: Equity-Indexed Universal Life\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nPOLICY OWNER AND INSURED\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nOwner: Jessica Lynn Thompson\nInsured: Jessica Lynn Thompson\nDOB: January 25, 1980 | Age: 44 | Gender: Female\nUnderwriting Class: Standard Plus Non-Tobacco\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nPOLICY SPECIFICATIONS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nInitial Face Amount: $500,000\nDeath Benefit Option: Option 1 (Level)\nPlanned Annual Premium: $6,000\nMinimum Premium to Keep Policy in Force: Varies by year\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nBENEFICIARY\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nPrimary: Matthew Scott Thompson (Spouse) - 100%\nContingent: Thompson Family Trust - 100%\n\n══════════════════","summary":"This Indexed Universal Life (IUL) insurance policy, issued by Horizon Wealth Protection Insurance, provides a $500,000 death benefit under Option 1 (level), designed for Jessica Lynn Thompson, aged 44, classified as Standard Plus Non-Tobacco. It features planned annual premiums of $6,000, with flexibility in minimum payments to maintain coverage. Primary beneficiary is her spouse, Matthew Scott Thompson, while the contingent beneficiary is the Thompson Family Trust.","topics":["Life Insurance","Financial Planning","Beneficiary Designation","Universal Life Policy"],"facts":[{"name":"Policy Identification Number","s