<node id="1a8167c6-3d1c-4e70-b50a-e88ae5c0a35e">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Surrender &amp; Lapse Provisions","text":"═════════════════════════\n8.1 If you surrender within first 12 years:\n\n    Year 1: 10% | Year 4: 7% | Year 7: 4% | Year 10: 1%\n    Year 2: 9%  | Year 5: 6% | Year 8: 3% | Year 11: 0.5%\n    Year 3: 8%  | Year 6: 5% | Year 9: 2% | Year 12+: 0%\n\n8.2 Surrender charge is calculated as a percentage of premiums \n    paid in the first 10 years.\n\n8.3 Cash Surrender Value = Account Value - Surrender Charge - \n    Outstanding Loans\n\n8.4 FREE PARTIAL WITHDRAWAL: You may withdraw up to 10% of \n    account value each year without surrender charge after Year 1.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 9 - NO LAPSE GUARANTEE RIDER (OPTIONAL - NOT SELECTED)\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nAvailable as optional rider: Guarantees coverage will not lapse \neven if account value drops to zero, as long as minimum guaranteed \npremiums are paid. Not currently elected on this policy.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 10 - POLICY LAPSE AND GRACE PERIOD\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n10.1 If account value is insufficient to pay monthly deductions, \n     we will notify you at least 30 days before lapse.\n\n10.2 Grace period: 61 days to pay sufficient premium to bring \n     policy back in force.\n\n10.3 If premium not received within grace period, policy lapses \n     and any remaining surrender","summary":"Surrender charges apply during the first 12 years, decreasing annually from 10% to 0%. They are calculated as a percentage of premiums paid in the first decade. The cash surrender value equals the account value minus surrender charges and outstanding loans. Policyholders can make tax-free partial withdrawals up to 10% of the account value yearly after the first year. A no-lapse guarantee rider is available but not elected. If premiums aren't maintained, the insurer provides a 61-day grace period; failure to pay results in policy lapse.","topics":["Surrender Charges","Cash Surrender Value","Policy Lapse","Partial Withdrawals"],"facts":[{"name":"Surrender Charges Within 12 Years","sentence":"Surrender charges apply if the policyholder surrenders within the first 12 years.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Surrender Charges","Policy Surrender Timeline","First 12 Years"],"entities":[{"name":"Year 1","type":"DATE","role":"first-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["10%"]},{"name":"Year 2","type":"DATE","role":"second-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["9%"]},{"name":"Year 3","type":"DATE","role":"third-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["8%"]},{"name":"Year 4","type":"DATE","role":"fourth-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["7%"]},{"name":"Year 5","type":"DATE","role":"fifth-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["6%"]},{"name":"Year 6","type":"DATE","role":"sixth-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["5%"]},{"name":"Year 7","type":"DATE","role":"seventh-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["4%"]},{"name":"Year 8","type":"DATE","role":"eighth-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["3%"]},{"name":"Year 9","type":"DATE","role":"ninth-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["2%"]},{"name":"Year 10","type":"DATE","role":"tenth-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["1%"]},{"name":"Year 11","type":"DATE","role":"eleventh-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["0.5%"]},{"name":"Year 12+","type":"DATE","role":"twelfth-or-later-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["0%"]},{"name":"Surrender charge","type":"CONCEPT","role":"penalty deducted upon early withdrawal","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Premiums paid in the first 10 years","type":"CONCEPT","role":"basis for calculating surrender charge","relational_anchors":["first 10 years"]},{"name":"Cash Surrender Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"net amount available upon surrender","relational_anchors":["Account Value","Surrender Charge","Outstanding Loans"]},{"name":"FREE PARTIAL WITHDRAWAL","type":"CONCEPT","role":"charge-free annual withdrawal allowance","relational_anchors":["up to 10%","account value","each year","after Year 1"]},{"name":"ARTICLE 9 - NO LAPSE GUARANTEE RIDER (OPTIONAL - NOT SELECTED)","type":"ARTICLE","role":"optional benefit guaranteeing continued coverage","relational_anchors":["Optional","Not selected"]},{"name":"No Lapse Guarantee Rider","type":"CONCEPT","role":"protection against policy termination due to low balance","relational_anchors":["Guarantees coverage will not lapse","minimum guaranteed premiums"]},{"name":"ARTICLE 10 - POLICY LAPSE AND GRACE PERIOD","type":"ARTICLE","role":"rules governing policy expiration and recovery window","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Grace period","type":"CONCEPT","role":"time window to reinstate lapsed policy","relational_anchors":["61 days","pay sufficient premium"]}]},{"name":"Year 1 Surrender Charge","sentence":"The surrender charge in Year 1 is 10%.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Surrender Charge","Year 1","Premiums Paid"],"entities":[{"name":"Year 1","type":"DATE","role":"first-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["10%"]},{"name":"Year 2","type":"DATE","role":"second-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["9%"]},{"name":"Year 3","type":"DATE","role":"third-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["8%"]},{"name":"Year 4","type":"DATE","role":"fourth-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["7%"]},{"name":"Year 5","type":"DATE","role":"fifth-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["6%"]},{"name":"Year 6","type":"DATE","role":"sixth-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["5%"]},{"name":"Year 7","type":"DATE","role":"seventh-year surrender penalty point","relational_anchors":["4%"]},{"name":"Year 8","type":"DATE","role":"ei