<edge source="40540f90-c462-4dab-9e61-80aa1b26d734" target="95809504-b954-435b-8fa9-5edfda35ba72">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 elaborates on the indexing methodology that determines how the cash value grows within the IUL policy, explaining the rules governing returns based on specified indices.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
