  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 confirms the formal issuance and legitimacy of the policy document, providing authoritative context such as date, location, and institutional verification through seals and contact details.</data>
  <data key="d4">confirms legitimacy</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
