<edge source="40540f90-c462-4dab-9e61-80aa1b26d734" target="13af4faa-d9b6-470b-ae94-68c01a26e0f3">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 elaborates on crucial policy limitations and protections—such as the suicide exclusion and grace period—that directly affect the viability and scope of the $500,000 death benefit promised.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="40540f90-c462-4dab-9e61-80aa1b26d734" target="13fd241e-902f-4911-bb6b-9f0c8e8565dd">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 explains how the policy maintains value during market declines and clarifies the financial mechanisms behind premium payments and ongoing costs, providing deeper context for the stated $6,000 annual premium and long-term sustainability.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="40540f90-c462-4dab-9e61-80aa1b26d734" target="1a8167c6-3d1c-4e70-b50a-e88ae5c0a35e">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 explains critical terms governing the policy’s longevity and financial flexibility, including surrender penalties, withdrawal rights, and lapse risks that affect how the $500,000 death benefit and $6,000 annual premiums function over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="40540f90-c462-4dab-9e61-80aa1b26d734" target="d8d0da96-b065-45fe-bbc8-b9e25338f081">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 introduces a separate investment vehicle that complements the life insurance policy by offering tax-deferred growth opportunities and downside protection, potentially supporting wealth accumulation alongside the insured’s estate objectives.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements with investment</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="40540f90-c462-4dab-9e61-80aa1b26d734" target="ace98cbe-a140-431b-a929-c765e9e38299">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 provides essential context about the flexible death benefit options, loan availability, and associated fees and charges that govern how the $500,000 level death benefit and $6,000 annual premiums function over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
