<edge source="85d5d6ec-ad6b-42c0-aa96-0ffaa07ffc38" target="deefe5c8-640f-408f-a9d3-69fdb6670c3a">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 assigns a unique identifier to the policy described in fact_sentence_2, enabling precise tracking and referencing of the $500,000 face amount.</data>
  <data key="d4">identifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="85d5d6ec-ad6b-42c0-aa96-0ffaa07ffc38" target="b2a30ea9-f6f0-4538-a482-ad994edbeb6b">
  <data key="d3">The policy number HWP-IUL-2024-7290 uniquely identifies the insurance contract associated with Jessica Lynn Thompson, who is the named insured.</data>
  <data key="d4">identifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="85d5d6ec-ad6b-42c0-aa96-0ffaa07ffc38" target="e399f893-720a-491e-9762-ced1c8d9eb29">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 assigns a unique identification number to the policy. This identifier links to the broader profile described in fact sentence 2, where the insured’s underwriting class is specified.</data>
  <data key="d4">identified by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="85d5d6ec-ad6b-42c0-aa96-0ffaa07ffc38" target="e1df3d86-8de9-47d8-afa0-06dda8b550f2">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 assigns a unique identifier to the policy, enabling precise reference. This identification supports confirmation that the policy belongs to Jessica Lynn Thompson, whose name is explicitly stated as the policy owner in fact sentence 2.</data>
  <data key="d4">verifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="85d5d6ec-ad6b-42c0-aa96-0ffaa07ffc38" target="38b91269-d890-44e6-8d3e-f8bfc905c69a">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 assigns a unique identifier to the policy, which helps distinguish it within records. This identification supports the categorization stated in fact_sentence_2, where the policy's form type—Equity-Indexed Universal Life—is specified.</data>
  <data key="d4">identifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="85d5d6ec-ad6b-42c0-aa96-0ffaa07ffc38" target="db5f42b7-e216-4454-b4f0-97dfc9c2dbc6">
  <data key="d3">The policy number uniquely identifies the specific IUL policy being discussed, which includes the selection of Option 1 (Level) for the death benefit. This identification supports referencing the correct policy when discussing its terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">identifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
