  <data key="d3">An Index Account uses market index performance to determine interest crediting; the Participation Rate specifies what portion of that gain is actually credited to the account.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
