  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the general principle that the Floor Rate protects against market losses by guaranteeing at least 0% credit. Fact_sentence_2 exemplifies this rule by confirming that the Global Diversified Index Account applies this exact 0% floor, demonstrating real-world implementation.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
