  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies that the Floor Rate is set at 0%, preventing any negative interest credits; this detail substantiates the "floor" component mentioned in fact_sentence_2 about interest being constrained by both upper and lower limits.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
