  <data key="d3">The Cap Rate of 10.5% on the S&amp;P 500 sets an upper limit on potential growth, which works alongside the Floor Rate’s lower bound to define the full range of possible crediting outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
