  <data key="d3">The Cap Rate of 10.5% for the S&amp;P 500 limits the maximum return, regardless of the Participation Rate, which governs how much of the actual index gain gets applied toward that ceiling.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
