  <data key="d3">The Cap Rate of 10.5% sets an upper limit on returns for the S&amp;P 500 Index Account, while the 100% Participation Rate ensures full exposure to positive gains up to that cap. Together, they determine the potential upside under the point-to-point method.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
