  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 specifies the maximum return rate (cap) for the S&amp;P 500 Index Account, while fact sentence 2 establishes that losses are prevented through a zero percent floor. Together, they define the full range of potential returns under the account's design.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
