  <data key="d3">The first sentence defines the cap rate for the S&amp;P 500 Index Account, providing specific detail about its performance limit. This context helps frame the broader set of available index accounts mentioned in the second sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
