  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states the cap rate for the S&amp;P 500 Index Account, while fact sentence 2 specifies the lower cap rate for the NASDAQ-100 Index Account. Both contribute to understanding how individual indexes are capped differently within the same product design.</data>
  <data key="d4">comparable</data>
