  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 describes the cap rate for the S&amp;P 500 Index Account, which complements fact_sentence_2’s assertion about the Global Diversified Index Account's 0% floor, highlighting consistent downside protection across index options.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
