  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 confirms the NASDAQ-100 Index Account also features a 0% floor, mirroring the protection mechanism already stated for the S&amp;P 500. This parallel supports the general rule that all listed index accounts maintain zero floors to prevent downside exposure.</data>
  <data key="d4">similarity</data>
