  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 sets the floor at 0%, meaning the account cannot lose value during downturns, which complements fact sentence 1's cap of 9.0% by defining the lower boundary of the return range, thus completing the parameterization of the NASDAQ-100 Index Account.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
