  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 specifies that the NASDAQ-100 account has a 0% floor, preventing losses from negative returns. This detail contextualizes the broader design principle seen in fact sentence 2, where the Global Diversified account uses an 8.5% cap to limit upside gains.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
