  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states the floor rate for the NASDAQ-100 account is 0%, while fact sentence 2 confirms the same floor rate applies to the Global Diversified account. Both statements reinforce a consistent risk mitigation feature across multiple indices.</data>
  <data key="d4">similarity</data>
