  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states the NASDAQ-100 Index Account has a 0% floor, consistent with fact sentence 2’s claim about the Global Diversified Index Account also having a 0% floor. Together, they highlight a common protective feature across different index accounts.</data>
