  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 establishes that the Global Diversified Index Account includes a 0% floor, preventing any downside risk. This supports the effectiveness of fact sentence 1's 100% participation rate by guaranteeing that participants benefit fully when markets rise without fear of losing principal during downturns.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
