  <data key="d3">The high participation rate of 100% in the Global Diversified Index Account enhances potential returns from market growth, while the absence of charges for reallocating funds on a policy anniversary supports investor flexibility in managing exposure across accounts.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e56d9b1f-113b-4961-abbd-159d8047aeca" target="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de">
  <data key="d3">The 100% participation rate in the Global Diversified Index Account means that if the index rises, the full gain is reflected in the account’s growth. This feature enhances the appeal of reallocating assets toward this account when favorable market conditions exist.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
