<edge source="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a" target="326a19f6-3d06-4cde-a9f0-0b1923801873">
  <data key="d3">The Fixed Account’s lack of a cap means it allows full realization of its guaranteed 3% return, unlike the Global Diversified Index Account, which is constrained by a ceiling of 8.5% on gains regardless of index performance.</data>
  <data key="d4">opposed by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a" target="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405">
  <data key="d3">Since the Fixed Account has no cap on returns, the guaranteed 3.0% annual interest becomes part of an uncapped growth opportunity, increasing investor benefit over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a" target="5970ce74-f216-4469-89e2-77ce18166763">
  <data key="d3">The lack of a cap means the Fixed Account has unlimited potential growth, which aligns with its stable, non-varying interest rate guarantee.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a" target="122014ab-154e-4331-94fc-e939755b46e6">
  <data key="d3">The absence of a cap in the Fixed Account means its returns are uncapped annually, though it still offers a guaranteed minimum yield. This feature may influence investor decisions regarding how much to allocate to it, such as the currently reported 20%.</data>
  <data key="d4">features account</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a" target="1b43685f-2a0d-488f-9258-b0a8a87ea9f1">
  <data key="d3">The Fixed Account lacks a performance cap, offering unlimited growth tied to its guaranteed rate, whereas index-based accounts are constrained by a minimum 4% cap to manage volatility exposure.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a" target="c4dbdf51-a4cd-4a65-8903-f269d529eefd">
  <data key="d3">The absence of a cap in the Fixed Account allows unlimited growth potential, which complements its guaranteed minimum return of 2%, ensuring investors benefit from strong performance while being protected against negative returns.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a" target="6ff1f4bc-a2b4-4e15-b514-415d803bd39b">
  <data key="d3">The Fixed Account operates without a cap on returns, differing from other accounts where interest is limited by a cap. This distinction highlights how the guarantee of a 3% yield applies independently of capping mechanisms.</data>
  <data key="d4">exception to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a" target="a7b1c147-442d-4852-b81d-665875dffa47">
  <data key="d3">The lack of a cap on the Fixed Account allows it to fully benefit from favorable interest rate movements, contributing to the overall stability of returns and helping ensure that investors avoid negative outcomes during market declines.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="80279852-0c27-437a-b564-6369c08fbc29" target="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a">
