<edge source="5970ce74-f216-4469-89e2-77ce18166763" target="f64306b3-60d7-48b6-82c2-6580397642e1">
  <data key="d3">The Fixed Account maintains a steady interest rate, offering predictability, whereas the Global Diversified Index Account protects against losses with a 0% floor. These features complement each other in stabilizing investor outcomes across account types.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5970ce74-f216-4469-89e2-77ce18166763" target="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405">
  <data key="d3">The unchanging nature of the Fixed Account’s interest rate confirms its status as a stable, guaranteed return regardless of market conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">ensures</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5970ce74-f216-4469-89e2-77ce18166763" target="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a">
  <data key="d3">Because the Fixed Account’s interest rate never varies, it naturally does not require a cap to protect against downside risk or volatility.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5970ce74-f216-4469-89e2-77ce18166763" target="2601679e-fb90-4392-b3a8-8e4aaa913aa1">
  <data key="d3">The Fixed Account offers a stable, unchanging interest rate, providing predictable returns regardless of market conditions. This consistency complements the ability to change investments at no cost on policy anniversaries, enhancing investor control over asset allocation.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5970ce74-f216-4469-89e2-77ce18166763" target="c4dbdf51-a4cd-4a65-8903-f269d529eefd">
  <data key="d3">The fixed nature of the account’s interest rate ensures predictable returns, which aligns with the guarantee that it will never fall below 2%.</data>
  <data key="d4">stabilizes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5970ce74-f216-4469-89e2-77ce18166763" target="a7b1c147-442d-4852-b81d-665875dffa47">
  <data key="d3">The Fixed Account offers a steady 3% return unaffected by markets, contributing to the product’s overall safety net that prevents negative returns during market declines.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
