<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="326a19f6-3d06-4cde-a9f0-0b1923801873">
  <data key="d3">Policyholders’ ability to modify allocations annually enables them to respond dynamically to changing conditions, including shifts in index caps like the 8.5% limit on the Global Diversified Index, thereby optimizing returns within structural constraints.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="e56d9b1f-113b-4961-abbd-159d8047aeca">
  <data key="d3">Policyholders’ ability to change investments annually allows them to shift funds into higher-performing accounts such as the Global Diversified Index Account, which offers a 100% participation rate, thereby potentially maximizing returns based on index performance.</data>
  <data key="d4">exposes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="f64306b3-60d7-48b6-82c2-6580397642e1">
  <data key="d3">Investors have the right to modify their asset mix annually, allowing them to respond to performance trends—including those tied to the Global Diversified Index’s 0% floor—which helps protect capital during downturns.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="7898028b-343b-4195-9f4c-a6280a62d640">
  <data key="d3">Allocation adjustments are allowed on policy anniversaries, which coincide with the conclusion of each 1-year crediting period for the Global Diversified Index Account, enabling timely rebalancing based on credited returns.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="13737585-4de1-4789-b42c-a05bc511593e">
  <data key="d3">The right to change allocations on each policy anniversary allows investors to update their exposure, such as modifying the existing 30% stake in the NASDAQ-100 Index.</data>
  <data key="d4">is enabled by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="2601679e-fb90-4392-b3a8-8e4aaa913aa1">
  <data key="d3">The ability to reallocate investments on a policy anniversary is enhanced by the absence of associated charges, making it financially accessible for policyholders to modify their portfolios at key intervals.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="6e7acf52-f866-478f-91af-c99f9dc14a24">
  <data key="d3">The ability to reallocate investments annually enables flexibility, which is enhanced by allowing up to four fee-free adjustments per year.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="65f18412-1464-4177-ad9f-477c8d9091d3">
  <data key="d3">The right to modify allocations on policy anniversaries enables flexibility, but exceeding four such changes incurs a $25 fee, limiting frequent adjustments financially.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="1b43685f-2a0d-488f-9258-b0a8a87ea9f1">
  <data key="d3">The ability to change allocations annually allows investors to respond to market conditions, potentially benefiting from the guaranteed minimum 4% cap on indexed gains, which protects against poor performance even if rebalancing occurs.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="0f6b3b49-d7b3-4758-a638-6cbce563fda7">
  <data key="d3">The ability to change allocations annually allows investors to respond to market conditions, potentially maximizing returns when participating in index growth under the 25% minimum participation rate.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="665dbf69-ad45-49be-8a49-a811282557e1">
  <data key="d3">Allocation adjustments happen annually on policy anniversaries, aligning with when index returns are calculated to determine credited earnings.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="27176921-2e5c-44aa-bcf0-40ddf6e140f2">
  <data key="d3">The ability to change allocations annually allows investors to shift funds into accounts whose performance feeds into the interest credit calculation, directly influencing outcomes governed by the participation rate and index movement.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="8886f5ce-b28a-43b5-85a1-63104105310a">
  <data key="d3">The ability to reallocate investments annually allows policyholders to influence which account’s performance affects returns, including those governed by caps and participation rates like the 10.5% cap mentioned.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="f1ca67d9-884a-4fc4-9ba1-cf7b354e9abd">
  <data key="d3">The ability to change allocations allows policyholders to respond dynamically to market conditions, reducing vulnerability when markets fall. This aligns with the guarantee that even in declining markets, no interest is lost—a key feature reinforcing confidence in active management.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de" target="3fe4c74a-f6e1-4f2e-874b-5a03244e9e44">
  <data key="d3">The ability to reallocate investments annually allows policyholders to adjust exposure based on anticipated or actual index performance like the S&amp;P 500’s 15% increase over a period.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual relevance</data>
