<edge source="2601679e-fb90-4392-b3a8-8e4aaa913aa1" target="e56d9b1f-113b-4961-abbd-159d8047aeca">
  <data key="d3">Free reallocation on a policy anniversary allows investors to respond dynamically to market conditions, potentially maximizing benefits from the 100% participation rate offered by the Global Diversified Index Account.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2601679e-fb90-4392-b3a8-8e4aaa913aa1" target="f64306b3-60d7-48b6-82c2-6580397642e1">
  <data key="d3">Making allocation changes on a policy anniversary is free, enabling investors to rebalance portfolios without financial penalty. This benefit complements the 0% floor in the Global Diversified Index Account by enhancing strategic control over risk exposure.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2601679e-fb90-4392-b3a8-8e4aaa913aa1" target="5970ce74-f216-4469-89e2-77ce18166763">
  <data key="d3">Investors may reallocate funds annually without penalty, enabling strategic adjustments to their portfolios. This freedom coexists with the Fixed Account’s guaranteed 3% yield, ensuring steady growth even when markets fluctuate.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2601679e-fb90-4392-b3a8-8e4aaa913aa1" target="2b2e3f84-59bf-4a6e-b26c-8b5ae353f6de">
  <data key="d3">No fee applies when changing allocations on a policy anniversary, which allows policyholders to exercise flexibility in managing their investment mix without financial penalty.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2601679e-fb90-4392-b3a8-8e4aaa913aa1" target="65f18412-1464-4177-ad9f-477c8d9091d3">
  <data key="d3">The absence of charges for policy anniversary reallocations implies flexibility within the allowed limit; however, exceeding four such changes triggers a $25 fee per additional request.</data>
  <data key="d4">exception to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2601679e-fb90-4392-b3a8-8e4aaa913aa1" target="6e7acf52-f866-478f-91af-c99f9dc14a24">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 states that reallocating funds on a policy anniversary has no cost, which aligns with the broader rule in fact_sentence_2 that allows up to four free reallocations each year. This suggests such timing falls under the permitted free transactions.</data>
  <data key="d4">includes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2601679e-fb90-4392-b3a8-8e4aaa913aa1" target="6ff1f4bc-a2b4-4e15-b514-415d803bd39b">
  <data key="d3">Policy anniversary reallocations occur at no cost, enabling investors to rebalance portfolios without financial penalty. This operational freedom complements the broader design where credited interest is bounded by a cap and protected by a floor.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2601679e-fb90-4392-b3a8-8e4aaa913aa1" target="a7b1c147-442d-4852-b81d-665875dffa47">
  <data key="d3">Changing allocations on a policy anniversary has no cost, allowing flexible management. This freedom complements the product’s design that protects against market downturns through a 0% floor.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2601679e-fb90-4392-b3a8-8e4aaa913aa1" target="f1ca67d9-884a-4fc4-9ba1-cf7b354e9abd">
  <data key="d3">Free allocation changes on policy anniversaries enable proactive management of investment risk, helping protect against adverse market movements. This operational flexibility complements the built-in 0% floor, which prevents any loss when markets decline.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances protection</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
