<edge source="c4dbdf51-a4cd-4a65-8903-f269d529eefd" target="f64306b3-60d7-48b6-82c2-6580397642e1">
  <data key="d3">The fixed account offers a guaranteed minimum yield of 2%, reflecting the product’s commitment to downside protection. Similarly, the Global Diversified Index Account includes a 0% floor, reinforcing consistent risk mitigation across both indexed and fixed components.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c4dbdf51-a4cd-4a65-8903-f269d529eefd" target="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405">
  <data key="d3">The 2% minimum guarantee ensures that the fixed account’s actual yield remains at least 2%, preserving the integrity of its higher stated 3.0% rate.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c4dbdf51-a4cd-4a65-8903-f269d529eefd" target="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of at least a 2% return in the Fixed Account ensures investor protection, making the lack of a cap more meaningful by allowing full upside capture when markets perform well.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c4dbdf51-a4cd-4a65-8903-f269d529eefd" target="d2272e16-5b5e-4cf0-8180-275ee09c4556">
  <data key="d3">Despite having no floor, the Fixed Account offers a guaranteed minimum return of 2%, ensuring stability even if other protections do not apply.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c4dbdf51-a4cd-4a65-8903-f269d529eefd" target="5970ce74-f216-4469-89e2-77ce18166763">
  <data key="d3">The assurance that the rate won’t drop below 2% implies its constancy, reinforcing that the rate does not vary over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">ensures</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c4dbdf51-a4cd-4a65-8903-f269d529eefd" target="6ff1f4bc-a2b4-4e15-b514-415d803bd39b">
  <data key="d3">The fixed account has a guaranteed minimum interest rate of 2%, illustrating how interest credits are protected from falling below a certain level—a key aspect of the overall floor mechanism applicable to all accounts.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.9</data>
</edge>
