  <data key="d3">The fixed account ensures at least a 2% return, contributing to the overall safety net that prevents any loss from market downturns. Together, this supports the claim that investors won’t face negative returns even if markets decline.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
