  <data key="d3">The fixed account’s guaranteed 2% yield contributes to increasing the account value over time, which forms part of the basis for calculating the cash surrender value described in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences indirectly</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
