  <data key="d3">The fixed account's guaranteed 2% interest rate ensures stable growth over time, which supports long-term savings goals that align with the ability to make free partial withdrawals after Year 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
