  <data key="d3">The fixed account’s guaranteed 2% minimum rate complements the protection offered by non-negotiable participation rate floors, both contributing to overall downside protection in the product’s crediting strategy.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
