  <data key="d3">The fixed account’s guaranteed 2% minimum yield complements the broader safety net described in fact_sentence_2, reinforcing that investors face no downside risk even if indices decline.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
