  <data key="d3">Under a 100% participation rate and 10.5% cap, the account’s growth is limited to 10.5% annually, regardless of index performance. This cap operates alongside the 0% floor, ensuring gains are bounded above yet never negative.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
