  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the ceiling on returns based on a cap and participation rate, while fact_sentence_2 explains that despite such ceilings, investors are shielded from negative returns through a guaranteed minimum of 0%. This creates a bounded risk-reward profile.</data>
