  <data key="d3">The absence of negative returns during market declines reinforces the purpose of capping gains—it allows for growth control while preserving principal through built-in downside protection.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables safety</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a7b1c147-442d-4852-b81d-665875dffa47" target="e56d9b1f-113b-4961-abbd-159d8047aeca">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee against negative returns during market declines underpins investor confidence in the indexed accounts, allowing features like a 100% participation rate to offer meaningful upside without exposing investors to loss risk.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a7b1c147-442d-4852-b81d-665875dffa47" target="f64306b3-60d7-48b6-82c2-6580397642e1">
  <data key="d3">Since market declines cannot cause negative returns, the presence of a 0% floor in the Global Diversified Index Account serves as the protective mechanism enabling this guarantee.</data>
  <data key="d4">protects</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a7b1c147-442d-4852-b81d-665875dffa47" target="7898028b-343b-4195-9f4c-a6280a62d640">
  <data key="d3">Policyholders are shielded from losses due to the 0% floor on indexed accounts, which ensures that despite market volatility—including declines—their credited returns cannot go below zero, supporting stable outcomes over each 1-year crediting period.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a7b1c147-442d-4852-b81d-665875dffa47" target="db06e7c6-2f5b-4dca-9e5a-d5dd96d2c405">
  <data key="d3">Protection from market declines through a 0% floor ensures policyholders maintain at least zero returns during downturns, reinforcing confidence in the product’s resilience. This safeguard works alongside the Fixed Account’s guaranteed 3% return to provide layered downside protection.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a7b1c147-442d-4852-b81d-665875dffa47" target="b24459ef-4087-463c-8274-73d1eef85c9a">
  <data key="d3">The presence of a 0% floor ensures no loss during market declines, which complements the Fixed Account's uncapped nature by providing reliable downside protection independent of index performance.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
