  <data key="d3">The guarantee against negative returns ensures investors retain value during market declines, supporting confidence in maintaining or adjusting allocations—such as the 30% allocated to the NASDAQ-100 Index—even under adverse conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">protects</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
