  <data key="d3">The policy ensures no negative returns during market declines due to a 0% floor, providing stability regardless of how often investors reallocate assets, including at no cost on policy anniversaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhanced by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
