  <data key="d3">Protection from negative returns during market declines is enabled by the 0% floor, which works alongside the 4% minimum cap to preserve capital and limit downside exposure.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
