  <data key="d3">The absence of negative returns during market declines is enabled by structural protections like the 0% floor, which work alongside the guaranteed minimum 25% participation rate to preserve capital and maintain positive or flat outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
