  <data key="d3">Since market declines cannot lead to negative returns for the policyholder, the fixed account’s guaranteed minimum yield of 2% aligns with this protective framework, reinforcing investor security.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
