  <data key="d3">The absence of negative returns during market declines stems directly from protective features such as the 0% floor, which overrides any negative outcome derived from the index percentage change calculation defined in the formula applied at policy anniversaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">result of calculation</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
