  <data key="d3">Even though interest is based on index performance and participation rates, the presence of a 0% floor prevents any negative returns during market downturns, making the calculation safe regardless of adverse movements.</data>
  <data key="d4">enforces</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
