  <data key="d3">Since market declines do not cause negative returns, it implies that a protective floor exists on interest credits, limiting downside risk regardless of market performance.</data>
  <data key="d4">caused by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
