  <data key="d3">Despite the existence of a cap at 8.5% on the Global Diversified Index Account, the 0% floor protects investors from losing principal or earning negative returns when markets decline, ensuring minimum stability in performance outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d4">protects against</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f1ca67d9-884a-4fc4-9ba1-cf7b354e9abd" target="e56d9b1f-113b-4961-abbd-159d8047aeca">
  <data key="d3">Even though the Global Diversified Index Account offers full participation in gains, its design includes a 0% floor ensuring no loss of credited interest during market declines.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances potential</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
