  <data key="d3">Even if the market declines, the policyholder’s credit is protected at 0%, meaning no loss occurs. This safety net complements the cap rule, which limits upside potential but maintains predictability.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
