  <data key="d3">Even in scenarios where the market declines significantly, the 0% floor prevents any negative crediting; combined with a 25% minimum participation rate, this ensures non-negative returns under adverse conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">ensures minimum return</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
