<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="99a2ea02-45ff-4204-9c3f-be85350484db">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 states that a market decline doesn’t lead to principal loss, which is made possible by the floor protection described in fact_sentence_1 when the index falls by 5%.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="7d57accf-750c-4143-addd-8dbbeb124299">
  <data key="d3">Since a market decline does not result in a loss of principal, it confirms that the policy includes a 0% floor protection mechanism, safeguarding the account value from negative returns.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="116850af-15ce-4679-bcc4-58d5753875d7">
  <data key="d3">The protection of principal during market declines means that even if the index drops significantly, such as by 5%, the account balance is preserved through zero interest crediting rather than negative returns.</data>
  <data key="d4">guarantees outcome</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="a53ff70e-2b10-4259-9e14-fe7adb0931b1">
  <data key="d3">The policy's protection against market declines ensures that the account value cannot drop below its current level, meaning the worst possible outcome is zero growth, or 0% interest earned over the year.</data>
  <data key="d4">ensures</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="50dee1d7-a696-448d-92e6-11dfe14d068f">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of no principal loss during market declines provides security that encourages flexible premium payments without fear of investment erosion.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances confidence</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="7d3930c1-6b23-4a04-93b3-d874c9e7b176">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of no principal loss during market declines provides security that encourages consistent premium payments, such as the minimum $100 requirement, helping maintain policy integrity.</data>
  <data key="d4">indirectly supports</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="44171d39-27ff-4fcc-bf40-58a3e92080fa">
  <data key="d3">The policy ensures no loss due to market declines, providing stability regardless of investment performance. This feature complements the minimum premium requirement of $100, which helps maintain the policy’s protective benefits over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual support</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="c0561218-4570-4bd7-925f-25cc01fd0c6d">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee that market declines do not cause principal loss ensures stability in the account value, supporting the ability to meet ongoing premium requirements like the recommended $6,000 annual contribution needed for lifelong coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="45f97aed-091e-480b-b637-f618f4e2486e">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee against market losses ensures stable account value, which helps maintain enough funds to meet monthly charges without requiring additional premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="2bf05a03-d336-46dd-a382-121bb038f1a6">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of no principal loss during market declines provides foundational security that enables the sustainability of the recommended contribution plan based on stable actuarial models.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="a6609e69-c5f5-4d6e-9fa1-fc83061e83ae">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee that market declines do not cause principal loss ensures financial resilience, allowing policyholders to potentially skip premium payments as long as the remaining account value suffices to cover ongoing costs like the cost-of-insurance and administrative fee.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="9639c325-d6a7-4181-a801-0a4fdfaefa94">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of no principal loss during market declines ensures stable account value, which influences the basis for calculating monthly COI deductions tied to the difference between the death benefit and account value.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="749f8b25-e9c6-4e2e-a60a-5fdcef1215c4">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of no principal loss due to market declines helps maintain a stable account value, which affects the basis for computing the monthly cost-of-insurance charge.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c">
  <data key="d3">The policy protects the principal from market declines, maintaining value integrity regardless of external economic fluctuations. This safeguard operates alongside recurring expenses such as COI and administrative fees, which reduce the account balance over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of no principal loss during market declines supports stable policy value, which complements the assurance that COI rates won't rise unexpectedly, enhancing long-term affordability and security.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="eec22563-c8f9-4930-abc2-6252103b7b77">
  <data key="d3">The assurance that market declines won’t cause principal loss, as stated in fact_sentence_2, is made possible by the 0% Floor Rate defined in fact_sentence_1, establishing a core safeguard in the product design.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="faf66c9e-da0e-4813-9561-2d1480419596">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee that market declines won’t cause principal loss is enabled by the 0% floor and 100% participation features outlined in the first chunk’s definition section.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="42ce1796-4b22-4fa1-987f-341d1746d7f3">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of no principal loss during market declines is enabled by the 0% floor used in the Point-to-Point Method's annual calculation, making the method consistent with the stated safety net.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="f64306b3-60d7-48b6-82c2-6580397642e1">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 asserts that market declines do not lead to principal loss, a principle mirrored in fact_sentence_1’s specification of a 0% floor on the Global Diversified Index Account, demonstrating consistent risk mitigation across different financial instruments.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="a7b1c147-442d-4852-b81d-665875dffa47">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 asserts that market declines won't cause a loss of principal in a life insurance policy, reinforcing the core guarantee described in fact_sentence_1 about avoiding negative returns during downturns.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="f1ca67d9-884a-4fc4-9ba1-cf7b354e9abd">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 confirms that market declines do not erode principal, directly supporting the implication in fact_sentence_1 that negative returns are avoided through built-in safeguards like the 0% floor.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="6f98a9e1-688e-4680-b305-6c7ecf379647">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee against principal loss due to market declines supports stable accumulation of cash value over time, enabling reliable eligibility for policy loans after one year. This stability enhances confidence in accessing borrowed funds without risking negative equity.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="e35519d3-d4b6-4a91-b9cc-794ecf0231f5">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee against principal loss due to market declines ensures the underlying account value remains intact, supporting higher surrender values over time, which in turn enables larger policy loans up to 90% of that value.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="84b477e8-9a8c-4a97-b7ac-12df058493f6">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee against principal loss due to market declines complements the availability of policy loans at a fixed 4% interest rate, ensuring stability in asset value while allowing access to funds without triggering losses.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="cdffaf84-8d6b-4f83-8142-43784e03289a">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee against principal loss due to market declines complements the understanding that policy loans still affect final payouts, ensuring investors know risks remain despite market protections.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="16db743e-8a3d-4763-8527-b5d06fd8aafb">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee against principal loss due to market declines complements the low net cost of policy loans, reinforcing overall financial stability and predictability of the insurance product.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="d39b66e7-d38a-450c-a287-bd1bf0a73d22">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee against principal loss due to market declines complements the stable return earned by borrowed funds in the fixed account, reinforcing overall policy stability despite market volatility.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="f75970d5-49e2-416e-98bf-26056a65e3f9">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee against principal loss due to market declines supports the stability of funds available for partial withdrawals, ensuring that early withdrawals do not erode protected capital. This reinforces confidence in maintaining sufficient account value to meet withdrawal thresholds like the $500 minimum.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7" target="6c81117f-d67b-45c8-b7c8-8a2a822df46d">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee against principal loss due to market declines complements the flexible withdrawal feature by ensuring asset stability when accessing funds early, though it doesn't affect withdrawal fees.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
