  <data key="d3">A recommended annual premium of $6,000 supports lifelong coverage and reflects prudent planning within the product’s design. This figure remains well below the $50,000 tax-qualified maximum, ensuring alignment with regulatory standards without exceeding allowable contributions.</data>
