  <data key="d3">Maintaining the recommended $6,000 annual premium helps avoid policy lapse, thereby preserving eligibility for potential future surrender charges like the 6% fee in Year 5. Without sufficient contributions, the policy might lapse earlier, negating such charges altogether.</data>
