  <data key="d3">Maintaining the recommended $6,000 annual premium helps ensure continued coverage into later years, reducing risk of lapsing before Year 6 when surrender charges still apply. This supports sustained policy viability despite existing surrender fees.</data>
  <data key="d4">complies with</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c0561218-4570-4bd7-925f-25cc01fd0c6d" target="fe831b43-8690-4c01-9873-79e0ef24ae00">
  <data key="d3">Maintaining the recommended $6,000 annual premium helps preserve policy value, reducing risk of significant losses when surrender charges like the 2% in Year 9 are applied.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c0561218-4570-4bd7-925f-25cc01fd0c6d" target="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3">
  <data key="d3">Maintaining the recommended $6,000 annual premium increases the likelihood of avoiding policy lapse and reduces risk of paying higher surrender fees, such as the 1% charge in Year 10.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c0561218-4570-4bd7-925f-25cc01fd0c6d" target="b29caae3-f13a-4b43-af52-606c74d4bb86">
  <data key="d3">Maintaining the recommended $6,000 annual premium ensures continued coverage into later policy years, where surrender charges have significantly decreased, such as the 0.5% rate in Year 11.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c0561218-4570-4bd7-925f-25cc01fd0c6d" target="8581e6b9-7fac-4b65-a5c3-f8bf614bbe73">
  <data key="d3">The recommendation to pay $6,000 annually aligns well with the absence of surrender charges after Year 12, enabling policyholders to commit to sustained contributions without fear of penalties upon withdrawal.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c0561218-4570-4bd7-925f-25cc01fd0c6d" target="120104c2-987f-4f54-a944-5d235a6dd5df">
  <data key="d3">The recommended $6,000 annual premium ensures continued coverage up to age 100, reducing risk of policy lapse; however, withdrawing funds early may trigger surrender charges based on premiums paid in the initial ten years.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.78</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c0561218-4570-4bd7-925f-25cc01fd0c6d" target="8e4cefcc-7f56-4cf2-9f4b-3e5dc497847a">
  <data key="d3">The recommended $6,000 annual premium helps build the account value over time, which is a key component used in calculating the cash surrender value described in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
