<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges, including COI and a fixed $12 admin fee, are subtracted from the account value regularly. Despite these deductions, the policy ensures that principal remains protected during market downturns.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="50dee1d7-a696-448d-92e6-11dfe14d068f">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges such as COI and the $12 administrative fee reduce the account value, so consistent premium payments—even when flexible—are necessary to maintain sufficient funds to cover these costs over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">necessitates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="7d3930c1-6b23-4a04-93b3-d874c9e7b176">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges such as COI and the $12 administrative fee are subtracted from the account value, meaning consistent premium contributions above $100 help maintain enough balance to absorb these recurring costs.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="c0561218-4570-4bd7-925f-25cc01fd0c6d">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges such as COI and the $12 administrative fee impact the account value, making consistent contributions like the recommended $6,000 essential to maintaining coverage through retirement.</data>
  <data key="d4">necessitates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="a6609e69-c5f5-4d6e-9fa1-fc83061e83ae">
  <data key="d3">The presence of fixed monthly charges like COI and admin fees determines whether skipping premium payments remains feasible, based on remaining account balance.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="45f97aed-091e-480b-b637-f618f4e2486e">
  <data key="d3">Understanding that monthly charges include both COI and an administrative fee helps explain why the account value must remain high enough to absorb them without requiring additional premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">necessitates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="6c580dbf-ec5e-4009-845b-7efb65de3c5a">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges incorporate an administrative fee, which is funded through the 3.5% premium load assessed on each payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">funding source</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="e4d325d0-3102-4ecf-b8a5-e488e84fa28f">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges comprise multiple components, one of which is the Cost of Insurance (COI), making it a constituent element of the total charge.</data>
  <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="9639c325-d6a7-4181-a801-0a4fdfaefa94">
  <data key="d3">Total monthly charges comprise the cost-of-insurance (COI), which varies depending on the difference between the death benefit and account value, plus a flat administrative fee.</data>
  <data key="d4">includes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79">
  <data key="d3">The total monthly charges encompass the $12 administrative fee along with other costs like the cost-of-insurance.</data>
  <data key="d4">includes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="749f8b25-e9c6-4e2e-a60a-5fdcef1215c4">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 identifies that total monthly charges comprise COI and administrative fees; fact_sentence_1 specifies the exact computation used to determine the COI portion of those charges.</data>
  <data key="d4">part of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa">
  <data key="d3">The mention of fixed COI rates ensures predictable monthly expenses, directly supporting the accuracy of the statement about total monthly charges being composed of known components.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08">
  <data key="d3">The mention of total monthly charges comprising COI and administrative fees sets up the basis for understanding what is being deducted. These combined charges are systematically removed from the account value on the third day of every month.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="4392497f-15c1-48ee-8067-43a8245bc89e">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges like COI and admin fees reduce the account value regularly, potentially increasing the relative burden of surrender charges when exiting early, especially if funds have grown slowly due to these recurring costs.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="01ec375d-e72b-4c13-96a2-da5a23238018">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges reduce the account value incrementally, affecting the total amount available upon surrender, thereby influencing the effective cost of the 10% Year 1 surrender charge.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="273e0e6e-5536-4336-a312-2596a9f16c8b">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges like COI and admin fees reduce the account value consistently, potentially affecting the amount available when calculating surrender charges later. Thus, these recurring deductions may indirectly influence the net cash surrender value used in determining surrender charges.</data>
  <data key="d4">indirectly affects</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="9dcea0cf-204b-429a-93cc-c257133b7890">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges like COI and admin fees gradually erode the account value, reducing potential funds available when considering a surrender. This cumulative reduction may increase the effective burden of a surrender charge such as the 9% in Year 2, especially if the account has grown slowly due to these ongoing costs.</data>
  <data key="d4">compounds charge</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.78</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="5935cab6-342e-4e3e-9ea8-dbff499af332">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges like COI and admin fees reduce the account value consistently, potentially affecting the amount available when calculating surrender charges later on. Thus, these recurring deductions influence the net account value subject to surrender fees.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="84b84dec-45b7-4ca8-ae2f-a68466866f24">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges like COI and admin fees gradually erode the account value, reducing potential cash surrender value, which may increase the effective cost of exiting the policy in Year 6 under a 5% surrender charge.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences value</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="00111295-2bb8-4547-912d-c65ce0d8d633">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges like COI and admin fees reduce the account value consistently, potentially affecting the amount available when calculating surrender charges later on. Thus, these recurring fees indirectly influence the net cash surrender value used in determining surrender charges.</data>
  <data key="d4">indirectly affects</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="29e19c25-f1c1-4c3e-8db6-46bce82c0dca">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges like COI and admin fees reduce the account value consistently, potentially affecting the amount available when calculating surrender charges later on. Thus, these ongoing deductions influence the net account balance subject to surrender fees.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="fe831b43-8690-4c01-9873-79e0ef24ae00">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges like COI and admin fees reduce the account value consistently, potentially affecting the amount available when calculating surrender charges later. Thus, these recurring deductions influence the net account value subject to surrender fees.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="b29caae3-f13a-4b43-af52-606c74d4bb86">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges like COI and admin fees contribute to the overall cost burden over time, influencing the accumulation of cash value that may affect surrender outcomes later. In Year 11, when the surrender charge remains low (0.5%), these cumulative charges could impact net surrender proceeds.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="120104c2-987f-4f54-a944-5d235a6dd5df">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges like COI and admin fees affect the account value over time, which influences the basis for calculating surrender charges tied to initial premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c" target="8581e6b9-7fac-4b65-a5c3-f8bf614bbe73">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges reduce the account value consistently, affecting how much remains when considering future surrenders. Since surrender charges vanish after Year 12, holding the policy past this point minimizes penalties, making sustained payments more financially viable given the persistent monthly costs.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
