<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="50dee1d7-a696-448d-92e6-11dfe14d068f">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges being deducted on the third day of each month means that timely premium payments should ideally precede this date to ensure sufficient funds remain in the account.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="7d3930c1-6b23-4a04-93b3-d874c9e7b176">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges being deducted on the third day of each month depends on prior receipt of premiums, making the minimum payment condition relevant to sustaining the account's ability to cover such deductions.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="c0561218-4570-4bd7-925f-25cc01fd0c6d">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges being deducted from the account value require regular contributions like the recommended $6,000 to prevent depletion of funds.</data>
  <data key="d4">needs</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="a6609e69-c5f5-4d6e-9fa1-fc83061e83ae">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges, including cost-of-insurance and administrative fees, are deducted from the account value on the third day of each month. This deduction schedule allows holders to avoid premium payments as long as funds remain adequate after the charge.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="45f97aed-091e-480b-b637-f618f4e2486e">
  <data key="d3">The deduction of total charges on the third day of each month creates a fixed deadline for ensuring the account has enough funds to avoid negative impacts on coverage, especially relevant when considering whether to skip premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">timing condition</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="0d7fabe2-d74d-4b84-a620-42c9acb1c43d">
  <data key="d3">Monthly deductions from the account value include the 3.5% premium load, meaning the initial loading fee is incorporated into recurring financial adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d4">includes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="6c580dbf-ec5e-4009-845b-7efb65de3c5a">
  <data key="d3">Monthly deductions on the third day include the premium load, which funds administrative and operational expenses outlined in the earlier statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">preceded by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="e4d325d0-3102-4ecf-b8a5-e488e84fa28f">
  <data key="d3">Since Total Charges are deducted on the third day of each month, and COI is included within those charges, it follows that COI is also deducted on that date.</data>
  <data key="d4">included in</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="9639c325-d6a7-4181-a801-0a4fdfaefa94">
  <data key="d3">Since total charges, including COI, are deducted from the account value every month, the amount of COI itself is determined by the disparity between the death benefit and current account value.</data>
  <data key="d4">informs</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="749f8b25-e9c6-4e2e-a60a-5fdcef1215c4">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges, including those derived from the COI calculation, are deducted from the account value on the third day of each month, ensuring consistent application of financial obligations tied to the policy’s structure.</data>
  <data key="d4">deducted on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="6bfb8452-bcec-4db6-b212-fd25bdcfbc79">
  <data key="d3">Since the total monthly charges are deducted on the third day of the month, the $12 administrative fee is included in those deductions.</data>
  <data key="d4">included in</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa">
  <data key="d3">The regular monthly deduction of charges from the account value depends on the stability of COI rates, which are locked at guaranteed levels, ensuring predictability in how much is subtracted over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c">
  <data key="d3">Since total monthly charges include COI and administrative fees, they are subject to deduction from the account value. This deduction occurs consistently on the third day of each month, aligning with the charge composition described earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">caused by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="4392497f-15c1-48ee-8067-43a8245bc89e">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges reduce the account value regularly, affecting long-term accumulation, while surrender charges may further diminish the payout if the policy is terminated early, compounding the impact on net value.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges are regularly deducted from the account value, affecting its growth over time, whereas the Year 10 surrender charge represents a potential future deduction upon policy cancellation, reflecting long-term contractual terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08" target="8e4cefcc-7f56-4cf2-9f4b-3e5dc497847a">
  <data key="d3">Monthly charges reduce the account value consistently, which directly affects the calculation of cash surrender value over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
