<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="99a2ea02-45ff-4204-9c3f-be85350484db">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed maximum COI rates ensure predictable ongoing expenses, supporting consistent policy sustainability despite potential market volatility protected by the 5% floor.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="7d57accf-750c-4143-addd-8dbbeb124299">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed maximum COI rates prevent unexpected increases in insurance costs, supporting long-term affordability. This aligns with the 0% floor protection by maintaining consistent financial safeguards throughout the policy term.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="116850af-15ce-4679-bcc4-58d5753875d7">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed COI rate ceilings ensure stable ongoing expenses regardless of policy duration. This contrasts with the index-linked crediting mechanism, which only prevents losses during market dips without affecting expense structures.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="70667dae-ff8c-4bac-bf04-03807ddb6bd7">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed COI rates ensure predictable costs over time, reinforcing confidence in maintaining coverage despite potential market volatility, where principal protection also plays a key role.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="86b72d75-5a59-44c2-b2d6-912ce393cf76">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed maximum COI rates ensure predictable ongoing costs, enabling policyholders to plan contributions without fear of sudden increases, regardless of when premiums are paid.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="7d3930c1-6b23-4a04-93b3-d874c9e7b176">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed non-increasing COI rates ensure predictable costs over time, making it easier for policyholders to meet the minimum $100 premium obligation without fear of sudden expense spikes due to rising mortality charges.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="c0561218-4570-4bd7-925f-25cc01fd0c6d">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed non-increasing COI rates make it feasible to recommend a consistent $6,000 annual premium for lifelong coverage without risk of escalating expenses.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="2bf05a03-d336-46dd-a382-121bb038f1a6">
  <data key="d3">The fixed ceiling on COI rate increases makes it reasonable to assume that current actuarial models remain viable over time, supporting the longevity of the recommended strategy.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="a6609e69-c5f5-4d6e-9fa1-fc83061e83ae">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed non-increasing COI rates ensure predictable expense deduction, enabling consistent account balance retention necessary for skipping future premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="45f97aed-091e-480b-b637-f618f4e2486e">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed constancy in COI rates enables reliable planning around account value management, making it feasible to rely on accumulated funds to absorb monthly charges when premium payments are deferred.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="e4d325d0-3102-4ecf-b8a5-e488e84fa28f">
  <data key="d3">Because COI rates are locked at policy-defined levels, they ensure that the monthly deduction process remains consistent and reliable throughout the policy term.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="9639c325-d6a7-4181-a801-0a4fdfaefa94">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed limits on COI rates ensure that even as the monthly charge varies due to changes in the death benefit or account value, it will never surpass the scheduled cap.</data>
  <data key="d4">constrains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="749f8b25-e9c6-4e2e-a60a-5fdcef1215c4">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed maximum COI rates ensure that the formula for determining the monthly COI remains consistently applicable without unexpected increases.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="0b7e0a06-5166-489d-a873-3b798f915e2c">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed maximum COI rates provide a foundation for stable total monthly charges, making the breakdown into COI and administrative fees more reliable over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e2637b0a-dd20-4e01-8fa1-8779d2f346fa" target="1b6d4d68-07ed-4c80-987c-ddf958d36f08">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed maximum COI rates ensure that the amount deducted monthly from the account value remains within defined limits, supporting financial planning based on known charge structures.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
