  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">charge</data>
</edge>
<edge source="99ca8905-b57d-4689-9164-12678eda198b" target="65952631-b367-45d2-80e9-20b6c0629bf1">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">year</data>
</edge>
<edge source="99ca8905-b57d-4689-9164-12678eda198b" target="fb14204a-ae31-4a99-9e5d-a9f08e83ebaa">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">year</data>
</edge>
<edge source="99ca8905-b57d-4689-9164-12678eda198b" target="f48d18db-916a-4e9a-ad5c-8b176c59da3c">
  <data key="d3">The higher ongoing charges of Option 2 are directly attributable to its increased costs relative to Option 1, emphasizing the trade-off in pricing models.</data>
  <data key="d4">comparative difference</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="99ca8905-b57d-4689-9164-12678eda198b" target="3d7d5200-92e7-4186-968d-e19ab1fbc8b6">
  <data key="d3">Higher ongoing charges in Option 2 fund the mechanism enabling the death benefit to grow alongside the account value, making it possible for the benefit to increase over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="99ca8905-b57d-4689-9164-12678eda198b" target="554b41df-0ff4-46de-a895-a7a081334009">
  <data key="d3">Higher ongoing charges in Option 2 influence the effective account value over time, which impacts how much can be withdrawn without triggering penalties. This affects the maximum allowable partial withdrawal, constrained by remaining account value after deducting applicable surrender charges.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="99ca8905-b57d-4689-9164-12678eda198b" target="3493040d-88ba-470b-9604-c6e5ce8f6501">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for evidence of insurability when increasing coverage relates to why Option 2 has higher ongoing charges, as it involves greater risk and administrative complexity.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="99ca8905-b57d-4689-9164-12678eda198b" target="e9cf97a9-cf24-4d3c-adf8-586c6935d0e1">
  <data key="d3">The statement about higher ongoing charges in Option 2 is part of a broader set of policy terms issued by Horizon Wealth Protection Insurance, establishing the institutional context for the financial details.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
