  <data key="d3">From chunk 2’s perspective, chunk 1 establishes the core identity of the policy—including beneficiaries, face amount, and classification—that gives context to the mechanisms described in chunk 2, making those rules applicable to a specific individual and product.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual relation</data>
