  <data key="d3">From chunk 2’s perspective, chunk 1 provides essential context about how gains are generated and capped across different investment options, which underpins the long-term growth assumptions used in calculating surrender values and withdrawal impacts.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual relation</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
