<edge source="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3" target="4392497f-15c1-48ee-8067-43a8245bc89e">
  <data key="d3">The 1% surrender charge in Year 10 exemplifies the broader rule that surrender fees gradually diminish over the initial 12-year period, reflecting an annual reduction schedule applied uniformly across those years.</data>
  <data key="d4">part of sequence</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3" target="01ec375d-e72b-4c13-96a2-da5a23238018">
  <data key="d3">The 1% surrender charge in Year 10 reflects the cumulative effect of annual reductions beginning from the 10% rate set in Year 1, illustrating a consistent downward trend over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3" target="9dcea0cf-204b-429a-93cc-c257133b7890">
  <data key="d3">The 1% surrender charge in Year 10 follows naturally from the gradual reduction beginning at 10% in Year 1. It confirms the sustained decline observed in Year 2’s 9% charge.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3" target="273e0e6e-5536-4336-a312-2596a9f16c8b">
  <data key="d3">The low surrender charge of 1% in Year 10 reflects the ongoing reduction from higher initial rates, such as the 8% charge in Year 3, confirming the gradual decline across the first decade.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3" target="5935cab6-342e-4e3e-9ea8-dbff499af332">
  <data key="d3">The 1% surrender charge in Year 10 logically follows from the gradual reduction described earlier, confirming the ongoing decline initiated in Year 4.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3" target="00111295-2bb8-4547-912d-c65ce0d8d633">
  <data key="d3">The 1% surrender charge in Year 10 logically follows from the earlier 6% charge in Year 5, reflecting an ongoing downward trajectory in fees across the policy term.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3" target="84b84dec-45b7-4ca8-ae2f-a68466866f24">
  <data key="d3">The surrender charge at Year 10 is 1%, lower than the 5% charge in Year 6, demonstrating progression through the scheduled annual reductions outlined in the policy terms.</data>
