<edge source="a3cf559b-392a-434d-8391-67212bc086c3" target="22fdc352-4139-456b-bd73-2207bfdefc4e">
  <data key="d3">A minimal surrender charge in Year 10 (1%) complements the 100% participation rate by reducing penalty risk when accessing funds after significant time, supporting liquidity without undermining index-linked returns.</data>
