  <data key="d3">The surrender charge in Year 11 is very low at 0.5%, reflecting its gradual decline toward zero by Year 12. This minimal charge aligns with the availability of free partial withdrawals after Year 1, enabling policyholders to access funds without fees despite earlier high charges.</data>
