<edge source="f693b3ab-ce04-4645-b10b-f2a647d0f872" target="d4b10129-f843-43a5-8362-ff505e1fb13b">
  <data key="d3">The insurer's obligation to provide advance notice before lapse only becomes significant because the No Lapse Guarantee Rider was not chosen, leaving the policy vulnerable to termination without additional safeguards.</data>
  <data key="d4">exposes vulnerability</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f693b3ab-ce04-4645-b10b-f2a647d0f872" target="12268e1c-c5d6-4433-beca-c792fd3b6311">
  <data key="d3">When the account value falls short of covering monthly deductions, the insurer notifies the policyholder at least 30 days prior to lapse, initiating a process that leads into the 61-day grace period where reinstatement remains possible.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f693b3ab-ce04-4645-b10b-f2a647d0f872" target="fed316a6-229f-46af-91a9-72511967565a">
  <data key="d3">When the account value cannot meet monthly deductions, the insurer notifies the policyholder ahead of time. If no action is taken, the policy may lapse, resulting in complete loss of any remaining surrender value.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f693b3ab-ce04-4645-b10b-f2a647d0f872" target="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc">
  <data key="d3">When the account value falls short of covering monthly deductions, the insurer notifies the policyholder at least 30 days prior to lapse, providing time to act. This pre-lapse notification precedes the final outcome described in fact_sentence_2, where non-payment during the grace period triggers actual policy lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f11ee75a-7717-4240-90dc-6521fcb8c85f" target="f693b3ab-ce04-4645-b10b-f2a647d0f872">
