</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="c9695180-7458-48f9-8686-914a2e999aa0">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums within the grace period leads to policy lapse, which underscores why the absence of the no-lapse guarantee rider makes such lapses possible—even though the rider could have prevented them had it been chosen.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="d4b10129-f843-43a5-8362-ff505e1fb13b">
  <data key="d3">Failure to maintain premiums leads to policy lapse after the 61-day grace period, especially without the safety net of a No Lapse Guarantee Rider, making such lapses more likely than they would be with the rider active.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="12268e1c-c5d6-4433-beca-c792fd3b6311">
  <data key="d3">If the required premium remains unpaid beyond the 61-day grace period, the policy terminates due to non-payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">result of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="f693b3ab-ce04-4645-b10b-f2a647d0f872">
  <data key="d3">Failure to receive the required premium within the 61-day grace period directly causes the policy to lapse, which follows logically from earlier financial insufficiency signaled by notifications based on low account value.</data>
  <data key="d4">caused by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc" target="fed316a6-229f-46af-91a9-72511967565a">
  <data key="d3">If the required premium isn’t paid within the 61-day grace period, the policy lapses, resulting in termination of coverage and cancellation of future benefits. After lapse, any accumulated surrender value becomes unrecoverable.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b01976cb-788e-4005-abe5-4e8f1e57e9c3" target="ae3f8271-673d-4549-8f9b-46011b263dfc">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">occurs in</data>
</edge>
