<edge source="e27b0a94-4088-4246-ba72-d6793b6cd04d" target="61eb2693-c254-4b76-aefb-4ce00bdc5d2b">
  <data key="d3">A 61-day grace period provides opportunity to restore coverage through premium payment; failure to do so results in policy lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e27b0a94-4088-4246-ba72-d6793b6cd04d" target="15cc61a2-a432-4cb5-8906-a25d63f7e7f6">
  <data key="d3">If the policyholder pays the required premium within the 61-day grace period, the policy remains active. However, failure to make such a payment results in lapse, triggering the release of the surrender value.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e27b0a94-4088-4246-ba72-d6793b6cd04d" target="66d61507-a301-4354-ad15-acfad1eafccb">
  <data key="d3">The grace period provides a window to reinstate the policy, making reinstatement possible; once reinstated, the suicide exclusion becomes active, limiting benefits if suicide occurs within two years.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e27b0a94-4088-4246-ba72-d6793b6cd04d" target="a416fa11-2b3f-4f38-958d-ff8e13bcbb1a">
  <data key="d3">The grace period provides time to restore coverage without lapse, ensuring continuity before any potential impact on participation rates. This temporal buffer supports the long-term assurance offered by guaranteed minimum participation levels.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e27b0a94-4088-4246-ba72-d6793b6cd04d" target="47fe3387-29bc-4869-a3a5-637bc22b6a91">
  <data key="d3">The grace period provides a buffer for reinstating coverage without losing benefits, while the mention of 'zero' as the hero highlights how the policy protects against losses from market declines, reinforcing its risk-mitigating design.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e27b0a94-4088-4246-ba72-d6793b6cd04d" target="fed316a6-229f-46af-91a9-72511967565a">
  <data key="d3">Without timely payment during the 61-day grace period, the policy lapses, resulting in the complete forfeiture of any remaining surrender value.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
