  <data key="d3">The concept that zero represents safety from losses reinforces why past performance should not be relied upon—it underscores inherent protections built into the product regardless of market swings.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
