<edge source="47fe3387-29bc-4869-a3a5-637bc22b6a91" target="05f6ec15-bbb6-4acf-8ed9-90e66f40d069">
  <data key="d3">The statement about zero being the "hero" reflects the idea of financial safety, which is concretely explained by the guarantee that policyholders won't lose money due to adverse index performance.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
