<edge source="47fe3387-29bc-4869-a3a5-637bc22b6a91" target="4323367b-0222-42cb-99fe-8a2785ec96d3">
  <data key="d3">The statement "zero is the hero" highlights the protective nature of the policy’s design, where negative market moves do not result in financial loss. This is supported by the rule that no dividend participation occurs during negative index performance, ensuring no downside impact on the policyholder.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
