<edge source="b1733959-f2c8-49a1-abbf-c49d75d321d4" target="87987c98-b6f9-450a-8c71-84809999dd2b">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 provides the toll-free phone number for contacting Horizon Wealth Protection Insurance. This complements fact sentence 2 by offering another direct method of reaching the company via its official website.</data>
  <data key="d4">supplements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1733959-f2c8-49a1-abbf-c49d75d321d4" target="9ac0c7c4-1321-469b-afaa-abe6d54dbd8e">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 supplies actionable contact information for the company identified in fact_sentence_2, enhancing verifiability and trustworthiness of the organization.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1733959-f2c8-49a1-abbf-c49d75d321d4" target="7c78ce63-cb1f-4b61-bdcd-88d0ce4bcb53">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the company's phone number reinforces the legitimacy of the document’s issuer, aligning with its stated execution in Chicago, Illinois, thereby supporting trustworthiness through traceable contact points.</data>
  <data key="d4">supplements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1733959-f2c8-49a1-abbf-c49d75d321d4" target="79f032d3-1299-41de-85c7-f944c1411556">
  <data key="d3">The contact information in fact_sentence_1 enables verification and outreach regarding the document whose execution date is specified in fact_sentence_2, supporting traceability and credibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">supplements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1733959-f2c8-49a1-abbf-c49d75d321d4" target="ba1c52cb-9fba-4846-9a66-8e0c71e2a754">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 provides verifiable contact details for Horizon Wealth Protection Insurance, while fact_sentence_2 confirms the physical presence of a corporate seal, lending authority and formality to the document containing those details.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
